## A `@dataflow:` block is ordered by data, not by line order.
## `attach` is registered with mutates=["graph"]: it updates its input in place,
## so a machine runs every earlier reader of that value first.
graph = {}
@dataflow:
    (with_b, a)attach(out)
    (graph, b)attach(with_b)
    ("photo", 2)crop(b)
    ("photo", 1)crop(a)
